Step 1: train the VAE by running:
  python eegmi251212001_universalVAE_30subjects_win9_centeraware.py \
     --data-dir EEGMI_numpy \
     --output checkpoints_vae_251210003/vae_universal30_win9_hd512_ld8_beta3e-04_251210003eegmiVAE_universal.pth \
     --epochs 100 \
     --batch-size 512 \
     --device cuda

“For deterministic GPU runs with torch.use_deterministic_algorithms(True) on CUDA ≥ 10.2, set CUBLAS_WORKSPACE_CONFIG=:4096:8 (or :16:8).”

